description	"Dr. Cornelius Evazan

A disgraced Surgeon, he uses his chemical expertise to assist and disorient.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- 15% Faster Movement
- SE-14C Blaster Pistol (3)
- Chemical Grenade (6)
-- 0 Damage
-- Applies Poison/Blind/Cripple/Force Focus/Tracking
-- Large Radius

^8Powers:
- Hallucinogenic Mist (Mindtrick 3)

^8Attributes:
- Medical Scanner (Stat Viewer)
- Dodge (3)
- Healing (3)
- Tracking Beacon
- Anti MT (2)
- 40% Faster Cooldowns
- 20% Faster Hacking

^8Abilites:
- Advanced Tracking Darts ^3[CS4]
-- Applies Poison/Cripple
- Quickthrow (3) ^3[CS2]
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Advanced Poison Darts (20) ^3[CS3]
-- Applies Tracking/Force Focus
- Health/Armor Dispenser (3) ^3[USE In Melee]"